  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add generic action-array message dialogs with independent captions, values, outcomes, mnemonics, default and cancel behavior. Route keyboard and pointer activation through the same action path, use display-column-correct bracketed buttons, and retain presentation-only scoped styles. Mark the legacy YesNo factory warning-level obsolete while preserving its signature and behavior. Give form actions matching mnemonic and cancel semantics. Preserve AssemblyVersion 1.0.0.0, Icod.DCurses 2.5.2, and the .NET 8/9/10 targets.",
